msgid ""
"``image.find_features()`` (Haar) renamed its ``scale=`` keyword to "
"``scale_factor=``. Update ``find_features(cascade, scale=...)`` calls to "
"``scale_factor=...``."
msgstr ""
"``image.find_features()`` (Haar) și-a redenumit cuvântul-cheie ``scale=`` în"
" ``scale_factor=``\\ . Actualizați apelurile ``find_features(cascade, "
"scale=...)`` la ``scale_factor=...``\\ ."

